  "summary": "Customer portals, automated emails, QuickBooks integration, Amazon Alexa integration are NOT reserved to large businesses with deep pockets. YOU can have these features in your software!\n\nI have spent the past 8 years as a software engineer designing and creating custom software for large manufacturing companies. Along the way, I discovered that small businesses are at a disadvantage when it comes to software options. Most I have known use Excel, or even Post-It Notes to run their entire business!\n\nSo I started offering my software development services to companies of all sizes and industries. \n\n- My clients are thrilled to have software that grows with them rather than hinders their growth. \n- My clients have recovered their investment in custom software thousands of times over with my software. \n\nI don't care if all you do for record-keeping is type data into a spreadsheet, I am here to tell you I can make it better. \n\nContact me right now, so we can discuss how your business can benefit from software designed specifically for you.",
