    "description": "Logistics Master Software LLC is a spin-off from KLAITECH Solutions. \n\nLogistics master is a fully-featured and custom dispatch system for the transportation industry. It began as a custom LTL freight application that is web-based and written in Ruby on Rails. It grew to encompass all aspects of trucking and was converted to be used by multiple companies on a monthly subscription basis.\n\nSome features include\n- Multi-stop, multi-vehicle route optimization\n- Customer portal\n- Driver portal\n- Carrier portal\n- Granular security on almost every action and button\n- Load builder\n- Invoicing\n- Quickbooks integration\n- Automatic miles and route optimization via ProMiles\n- Driver Payments\n- Expense tracking and reporting\n- GPS/ELD integration features with KeepTruckin service\n- Shipment and tracking notifications via text message and email\n- Kiosk to display scheduled loads on large office monitor\n\nFor more information, check it out at logisticsmastersoftware.com",
    "insights": "",
